  "body": "After upgrading matrix-synapse to the most recent version, the pop out in Element of jitsi doesnt work anymore, Inside a room it is working but when we click the button to pop out in other screen, it tells that the jitsi app cannot be load. the querystring parameters are not filled i found out. See below\r\n\r\nconferenceDomain=$domain&conferenceId=$conferenceId&isAudioOnly=$isAudioOnly&displayName=$matrix_display_name&avatarUrl=$matrix_avatar_url&userId=$matrix_user_id&roomId=$matrix_room_id\r\n",
